{"id":3112,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p><br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DU8QsRnzlZUl-bLZzM2nNCiLz-8L8-bPM47bozNinRNZMRC0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hkoShknkysnmGZozn2Mln2Mz78nR9aMN-DUzGZnlLDLNQFU4LsM4UPUmMFLNlinSb/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0Lz7aMkyPLzGaLYbw62E8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11003&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BB9BD7F0894F5DF514D806B6A08EC62F/C37741B3/2E5E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"201\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DU8QsRnzlZUl-bLZzM2nNCiLz-8L8-bPM47bozNinRNZMRC0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hkoShknkysnmGZozn2Mln2Mz78nR9aMN-DUzGZnlLDLNQFU4LsM4UPUmMFLNlinSb/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0Lz7aMkyPLzGaLYbw62E8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11003&e=.jpg\"></p><p>冯坤，汉族，共青团员，山西晋中人，中北大学计算机科学与技术学院计算机科学与技术专业2022级本科生。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Dnl7saMm7inmMkLZ4NiM77sMzQfM8UbanNWkUll4M8Csn7C0gihFp2hmCIa0USyinkhVL1hknzGPLlUZL7nRnNCaLmlbUm67MmG4LmCsolnFn7UDM4A2UzVFUzrfM1b/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0Lz7aMkyPLzGaLYbw62E8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11003&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A5DE2BE011D80DCFF0259B7D6032679D/DD678FA1/A5A6\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"410\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Dnl7saMm7inmMkLZ4NiM77sMzQfM8UbanNWkUll4M8Csn7C0gihFp2hmCIa0USyinkhVL1hknzGPLlUZL7nRnNCaLmlbUm67MmG4LmCsolnFn7UDM4A2UzVFUzrfM1b/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0Lz7aMkyPLzGaLYbw62E8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11003&e=.jpg\"></p><p>大学期间曾获得综合素质一、二等奖学金，校级三好学生，校友联合协会年度、月度优秀志愿者等荣誉。学科竞赛中，曾主持一项省级大创，获得全国三维数字化创新设计大赛、数学建模竞赛等数十项奖项。现已成功推免至中国农业大学攻读硕士学位。</p><p><strong>一、笃学慎思，筑牢专业根基</strong></p><p>本科前三年，冯坤始终以“致知于行”的校训为指引，深耕学业。前6学期平均学分绩点4.018，专业排名前4.8%。多门核心课程均取得优异的成绩，一次性通过英语四六级，具备了阅读英文文献的基本能力。在专业课的学习过程中，她学会了沉心静气、精益求精，这份笃学慎思的态度，也成为前行路上最坚实的底气。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DozVs2nlUbMlQfoZRCZnmlan7WfLN7bYMRCPoRlsLN-8nR70gihFp2hmCIa0oSybMkyaMYy4U8nRMzr2L4N4L7WVL8lbMRWRn7-YozGPoRVFLz62LmrRozQFUmL8L7lJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aLRLJqdEnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11003&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/994073CDC55F3930BE3E942CDB290181/17F25C96/B340E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DolWs2UzvbMRMRLZm-YU4vbMRv8nRvbbMRv4Um7aUzUPM870gihFp2hmCIa0nSysLkhkMShkMRMfUzMkM7WfolC4UlU8MRLDLNV7U87PUmfFnzGbol-YM8WFLmffUm9DgjfJQ4Oeo4xmvsU0qIbtpYyPLzG8g47PLRG4gtA8pUEcc&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11003&e=.png\"></p><p><strong>二、知行合一，深耕科研竞赛</strong></p><p>如果说课堂学习是知识的积累，那科研与竞赛便是实践的淬炼。大二学年，冯坤作为负责人参与一项省级大创项目“识眼辨人”，带领团队运用卷积神经网络、图像处理算法实现AI合成人脸的判定，为防范新型诈骗提供技术新思路。除此之外还也积极参加数学建模竞赛、三维设计大赛等，助力项目斩获佳绩。从项目立项到落地实践，从算法设计到代码实现，她在深度学习、优化算法、数据分析领域积累了宝贵实战经验，也愈发坚定了科研的决心。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DnzAskLRMkMN7sUZlr7MmW2U4f2MNCbDMmUsL7CinlWRUmL0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyDL1y8n1hVU4UZnm-iMRNYL7QRL8rfMRTkUz-ZozNZU8rFoRv8nm67nlWFMzUDnR7Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aLRLJqdEnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11003&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7624FEC48F254920FC3EA49BA28998CE/874F7DEB/546D1\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Do7-siMRTVozffnZzNDnmCsnzM7MlMb2MR7ZMRLinzGDnR-0gihFp2hmCIa0L1ybLkyZMkhkMm6RMmr2M8-PLNlYnNrko7LDMzGbL8WVozTFol7YU4-YL7MFLzWVLzGDgjfJQ4Oeo4xmvsU0qIbtpYyPLzG8g47PLRG4gtA8pUEcc&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11003&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DLzVs7Lmvanl7boZRCsMlV2MzT2oRCb8nmUDUmCbLRv8Lz70gihFp2hmCIa0oShVUYysUYh2MmA7nNLbUlr7LzC8LmNZnzLDnzTVMRTRUmMFMzQfLzQ2L4AFMzf7MzCJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aLRLJqdEnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11003&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9EC7CF68DFC9AED164298E36E9E49CB3/56A16F38/50D56\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DLzVs7Lmvanl7boZRCsMlV2MzT2oRCb8nmUDUmCbLRv8Lz70gihFp2hmCIa0oShVUYysUYh2MmA7nNLbUlr7LzC8LmNZnzLDnzTVMRTRUmMFMzQfLzQ2L4AFMzf7MzCJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aLRLJqdEnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11003&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DMmGsYMm9ZL8UbUZmN4Ll-8M7LbU4vbPnNVfLz9bMRv8oRv0gihFp2hmCIa0okybUSysLYh2UmMkMzA7LmGYMRlsL8WVLN7sLlLiLm-sMz6FU8-8nmUDnmnFMRGYU8-Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aLRLJqdEnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11003&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/89A73FB3B58D2024573BE2A71C522757/CB4F46F4/402CB\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"560\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DMmGsYMm9ZL8UbUZmN4Ll-8M7LbU4vbPnNVfLz9bMRv8oRv0gihFp2hmCIa0okybUSysLYh2UmMkMzA7LmGYMRlsL8WVLN7sLlLiLm-sMz6FU8-8nmUDnmnFMRGYU8-Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aLRLJqdEnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11003&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DLRrs7Lmvio7Q7UZlCYMzLiM4V2L4CbaUmCYUzLbL4Q7nl70gihFp2hmCIa0oSyiLkyZUYh2UlU4Um9PL8n2MNQ7MzUbMl-YM8U8M8C8LzfFLzvZMR9bnmnFMzUZM8UJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aLRLJqdEnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11003&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9508CFAD3B813DF6FD5495B27D47F410/178489F4/5487D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DnlnskUmVVnzCsnZz7PM49sMm-4UmvbbL77bLR-bnzGio770gihFp2hmCIa0USyDUSy8USysU4LPoRl4MznVL4l4MRGiL4-YM4QfUmLboz6FMzUiMmV2U4MFLz-YMlCsgjfJQ4Oeo4xmvsU0qIbtpYyPLzG8g47PLRG4gtA8pUEcc&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11003&e=.png\"></p><p><strong>三、躬身实践，提升综合素养</strong></p><p>“把个人成长融入更多人的需要里”，是冯坤在志愿服务中探索的初心，本科期间冯坤担任过校史馆副部，为校友与新生讲解校史，还担任过班级宣传委员，积极策划班级活动并撰写新闻稿，志愿时长共101.14小时，这些志愿经历不仅提升了她的表达能力，也深入诠释了责任与担当，更让她明白了志愿服务不是“完成任务”，而是在帮助他人的过程中探索自己与世界的联结，让成长更有温度。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DL4QsVnRLZU4G8UZmCaUzlPUz-bU8Ub4L8CiM478Lm9Znz90gihFp2hmCIa0MSybLShkU1yDnllDLNVVLmUbLl-DU4GZMlW7LRGin7LZnmfFozTVM4QknRMFLmVfnRUJqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aLRLJqdEnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11003&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/591BB6EE62AE2491B6C085BD005DC8F0/99E76BD3/21AD4\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DL4QsVnRLZU4G8UZmCaUzlPUz-bU8Ub4L8CiM478Lm9Znz90gihFp2hmCIa0MSybLShkU1yDnllDLNVVLmUbLl-DU4GZMlW7LRGin7LZnmfFozTVM4QknRMFLmVfnRUJqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aLRLJqdEnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11003&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DLRCsaL8-sLN7iUZm-aMm78MRl4UllbbL4U8MRL8LlUZMRv0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hVokhknSyZnlUDLl7bn77io7lZnzMfoR-sLzLYn7LiU4nFLNLYMzlsnNQFL4Wko7lJqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aLRLJqdEnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11003&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BE8BE8ED61A9DA58E8E3A827132DC5C4/2C2557FF/32B8E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DLRCsaL8-sLN7iUZm-aMm78MRl4UllbbL4U8MRL8LlUZMRv0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hVokhknSyZnlUDLl7bn77io7lZnzMfoR-sLzLYn7LiU4nFLNLYMzlsnNQFL4Wko7lJqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aLRLJqdEnx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11003&e=.jpg\"></p><p>回头看，轻舟已过万重山。向前看，前路漫漫亦灿灿。回首过去，曾经的困难与挑战都已远去。展望未来，前路虽然漫长，但也充满希望与光明。愿我们都能以乐观的心态，持之以恒地提升自我，不必为未来焦虑，只需专注当下。合理安排学习与生活，用于探索，大胆尝试，重在丰富人生体验。在过程中，不断成长，不断进步，成为更好的自己。</p><p><br></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://cst.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=DU8QsRnzlZUl-bLZzM2nNCiLz-8L8-bPM47bozNinRNZMRC0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hkoShknkysnmGZozn2Mln2Mz78nR9aMN-DUzGZnlLDLNQFU4LsM4UPUmMFLNlinSb/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0Lz7aMkyPLzGaLYbw62E8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11003&e=.jpg"}